1
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,900
The world was once divided in two.

2
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:14,850
The Aeth'er lived in one realm:
the skybound city of Dycroft.

3
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:23,800
The Er'ther lived in the other realm,
ruled by Dycroft from above.

4
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:29,750
Unable to endure the Aeth'er's oppression,
the Er'ther rose in rebellion.

5
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:38,700
This became known as the Aeth'er Wars,
history's greatest and worst conflict.

6
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:44,700
To oppose Dycroft, the Er'ther built
the airborne battleship Radisrol.

7
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:47,700
Then they launched an all-out assault.

8
00:01:02,650 --> 00:01:08,550
Yet before the might of the Aeth'er,
the Er'ther were defeated.

9
00:01:08,650 --> 00:01:14,550
The Aeth'er Wars ended in victory
for the armies of heaven.

10
00:01:14,650 --> 00:01:23,500
Though the war ended, its scars had ravaged
the land beyond all hope of repair.

11
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:32,500
Forests burned and mountains fell.
Rivers dried up; people lost their homes.

12
00:01:32,550 --> 00:01:41,450
Ruin below also reached the world above,
which relied on supplies from the surface.

13
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:50,400
With no path left but extinction,
everyone succumbed to despair.

14
00:01:50,450 --> 00:01:56,350
It was then that a hand of salvation
was extended to us.

15
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:11,300
God sent one savior down to the surface.

16
00:02:11,350 --> 00:02:14,300
Her name was Elrane.

17
00:02:14,350 --> 00:02:20,250
Elrane bestowed Lens upon the people.

18
00:02:23,300 --> 00:02:29,250
The Lens held a special power
that allowed them to survive,

19
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:35,200
even on a surface no longer fit for life.

20
00:02:35,250 --> 00:02:41,150
With the Lens, the people found hope again.

21
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:50,100
They repented and gave heartfelt thanks
to God, who had granted them salvation.

22
00:02:53,150 --> 00:03:02,050
We must never forget: we live today
only because God saved us.

23
00:03:02,100 --> 00:03:08,900
Nor must we ever repeat
the mistakes wrought by human hands.
